    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the underwater world and find all the differences!<br>Embark on an amazing adventure in the depths of the ocean! In this exciting game, 80 levels await you with images of marine animals\u2014from graceful dolphins to formidable sharks, colorful fish, and other sea creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At each level, you need to find 3 to 10 differences between two similar pictures.<br>The game is suitable for all ages\u2014it develops attention, relaxes, and brings joy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0a Suitable for the whole family<br>\ud83d\udc20 Colorful illustrations of underwater life<br>\ud83e\udde9 Simple and intuitive gameplay<br>\ud83c\udfaf A great way to train your observation skills</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready to explore the ocean and become a master of attentiveness?</p>",
